OL,3,GNEWSA'I quit my job at 51 and retrained
OL,4,Aas a butcher'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter running a care agency for 30
OL,7,Fyears, Emma Jenkins wanted to change
OL,8,Fher career. Realising a family-run
OL,9,Fbutchers was up for sale, she went for
OL,10,Fan impromptu viewing and is now the
OL,11,Fowner.
OL,13,FThinking of pursuing food-related work,
OL,14,Fshe said she "just thought I'd go and
OL,15,Fhave a look" at the premises in
OL,16,FEarlsdon, Coventry.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
