OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'I quit my job at 51 and retrained
OL,4,Aas a butcher'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut walking in and seeing then owner
OL,7,FStuart Taylor standing behind the
OL,8,Fcounter, made Jenkins appreciate the
OL,9,Ffamily-run background and she decided
OL,10,Fto buy the business as "it just felt
OL,11,Fright somehow".
OL,13,FShe was trained up by Taylor, whose
OL,14,Fgrandfather founded the business in
OL,15,F1938.
